  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aviation Technical Assistance Workshops Phase III FAA Transfer Funds, through U.S. Government - Department of Transportation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is enabling the U.S. Federal Aviation Administration to deliver training and program support for the USTDA-funded China Aviation Technical Assistance (ATA) Workshops Phase III. The ATA Workshops aim to strengthen the efficiency and safety of China&apos;s aviation system, while assisting U.S. companies in gaining market entry into the Chinese aviation sector. This amendment adds funding in the amount of $8,000 to transfer agreement between USTDA and the U.S. Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) to support FAA&apos;s participation in the USTDA-funded China Aviation Technical Assistance (ATA) Workshops Phase III. The FAA would deliver training and program support for the workshops in China.</narrative>
  </description>
